er a <strong>grups redu\u00efts<\/strong>, que valoren la privacitat i l&#8217;atenci\u00f3 personalitzada.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd51b61 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fd51b61\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"tours\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be04ca8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"be04ca8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67b11e4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"67b11e4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"86\" height=\"88\" src=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/tours-ciutadella-mao.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1165\" alt=\"Tours per Ciutadella i Ma\u00f3\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-95d64a9 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"95d64a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInDown&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Descobreix Ciutadella i Ma\u00f3: Les Joies Urbanes de Menorca<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a102e4a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a102e4a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b86cc1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3b86cc1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Ciutadella<\/strong>, antiga capital de Menorca, \u00e9s una ciutat carregada d&#8217;encant. Els seus carrerons empedrats, places hist\u00f2riques i edificis nobles com el Palau Episcopal i la Catedral de Menorca s\u00f3n testimonis del seu ric passat. Durant el tour, coneixer\u00e0s les llegendes i an\u00e8cdotes que amaguen els seus racons, gaudint de l&#8217;autenticitat del seu casc antic i el bullici del port.  <\/p><p>D&#8217;altra banda, <strong>Ma\u00f3<\/strong> \u00e9s una ciutat amb una ess\u00e8ncia molt diferent per\u00f2 igualment captivadora. El seu imponent port natural, un dels m\u00e9s grans del Mediterrani, contrasta amb l&#8217;entramat urb\u00e0 de cases colonials i edificis hist\u00f2rics com l&#8217;Esgl\u00e9sia de Santa Maria i el Museu de Menorca. Et submergir\u00e1s en la cultura local, descobrint mercats, caf\u00e8s tradicionals i llocs emblem\u00e0tics que reflecteixen el car\u00e0cter cosmopolita de la ciutat.  <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a54eb50 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a54eb50\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-72b04a7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"72b04a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"579\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?fit=2000%2C579&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-1194\" alt=\"Rincones de Menorca\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermenorca.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/rincones-menorca.jpg?w=2000&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/voyagermen